flowchart TD
    A["复杂意图难靠模型记牢（Intent too complex to recall）"] --> B["把意图压进确定性工具（Encode intent as a validator）"]
    B --> C["评审工具只暴露策略允许的操作，其余拒绝（Unyielding affordance）"]
    C --> D["代理产出物（Agent output）"]
    D --> E{"评审工具裁决（Critic verdict）"}
    E -- "失败：不可争辩" --> F["代理修改直到真的满足（Grind until it passes）"]
    F --> D
    E -- "通过" --> G["从『说服我你做完了』变成『让评审说通过』（Make the critic say yes）"]
    G --> H["完成可被独立证实（Verified completion）"]
    classDef core fill:#1a5fd0,stroke:#12449e,color:#ffffff;
    classDef gate fill:#fdf0ef,stroke:#e0b4b4,color:#8a3a34;
    classDef out fill:#edf1f7,stroke:#c9d6e6,color:#182430;
    class B,C,D,F core;
    class E gate;
    class A,G,H out;
